---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { PRIVACY_EMAIL } from '../consts.ts';
---
<Legal
  title="Cookie Notice"
  description="How Creators Sphere uses cookies and similar technologies."
  intro="This notice explains how the Creators Sphere website uses cookies and similar technologies, and how you can control them."
>
  <h2>What are cookies?</h2>
  <p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website. They help the site work, remember your preferences, and understand how it is used. The Creators Sphere mobile app uses equivalent technologies such as local storage and device identifiers.</p>

  <h2>How we use them</h2>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Type</th><th>Purpose</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Essential</td><td>Required for core functionality such as security and remembering your session.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Analytics</td><td>Help us understand traffic and improve the site (e.g. Google Analytics / Firebase).</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Preferences</td><td>Remember choices such as language.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Managing cookies</h2>
  <p>You can control or delete cookies through your browser settings. Blocking essential cookies may affect how the site works. On mobile, you can reset advertising identifiers and limit tracking in your device settings.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this notice? Email <a href={`mailto:${PRIVACY_EMAIL}`}>{PRIVACY_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
</Legal>
